  <div class="more-divider">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>
        <strong>That’s the short version.</strong> Below: how New Hampshire compares with other states, the math behind
        the cap, what happened in other New Hampshire cities with caps, open questions, an FAQ, and every source.
